Let $v \in \mathcal{G}^N$ be a game. Then, a coalition $S \in \mathcal{P}^\ast (N)$ is \textit{essential}, if either $|S| = 1$, or 

\begin{equation*}
v(S) > \max \limits_{\mathcal{B} \in \mathcal{D}_S} \sum_{T \in \mathcal{B}} v(T) .
\end{equation*}

Let $\mathcal{E}_v$ denote the class of essential coalitions of the $v$ game.

\begin{equation*}
